@startuml
' ============================================
' ooad-phase:   實作
' chapter:      12-1
' realizes:     UC-02, UC-03, FR-05～FR-11
' source:       frontend/focus-flow/src/components/navigationConfig.js, EnrollmentManagerModal.jsx, pages/TeacherDashboard.jsx, TeacherCourses.jsx, TeacherUpload.jsx（程式碼）
' verified:     2026-09-30
' status:       draft
' implemented:  yes
' ai-assisted:  yes / Claude Code / 依教師端課程管理彈窗與影片上傳追蹤程式繪製畫面移轉圖
' ============================================
!include ../_style.puml

title 教師端課程與影片畫面移轉圖
hide empty description

state "總覽" as home
state "課程管理" as courses
state "新增課程彈窗" as newCourse
state "修課學生管理彈窗" as enroll
state "掛載既有影片彈窗" as attach
state "刪除確認視窗" as confirmDel

state "上傳影片" as upload {
  state "選擇課程與影片" as pick
  state "上傳中" as sending
  state "處理追蹤" as tracking
  [*] -down-> pick
  pick -down-> sending : 按「上傳影片\n並建立 AI 索引」
  sending -down-> tracking : 上傳完成
  tracking --> tracking : 每 3 秒更新狀態\n或按「重新處理」
}

[*] -down-> home : 教師登入成功

home -down-> courses : 側邊欄「課程管理」\n或最近上傳「查看全部」
home -down-> upload : 側邊欄「上傳影片」\n或點選上傳影片卡片

courses -down-> newCourse : 按「新增課程」
newCourse -up-> courses : 建立或取消
courses -down-> enroll : 按「學生」
enroll -up-> courses : 關閉
enroll --> enroll : Email 加入、匯入 CSV\n或撤銷修課資格
courses -down-> attach : 按「掛載既有影片」
attach -up-> courses : 掛載或取消
courses -down-> confirmDel : 刪除課程或影片
confirmDel -up-> courses : 確認刪除或取消

newCourse -[hidden]down-> attach
enroll -[hidden]down-> confirmDel

@enduml
